=== DZ 1.5: button bounce counter ===
GPIO 16, INPUT_PULLUP, interrupt on FALLING, burst gap 30 ms
PRESS/HOLD = pin LOW after burst, RELEASE = pin HIGH after burst, TAP = press+release inside one burst
